  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "😇 Angel Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Real angel names with their meanings, or new ones in the same tradition: Raphael, \"God heals\"; Ithuel, Angel of Thresholds."
    },
    "intro": "Good angel names end in <em>-el</em>, the Hebrew word for God, which is why nearly all the traditional ones do: Gabriel is \"God is my strength\" and Raphael \"God heals\". This **angel name generator** gives you the angels named in scripture and tradition, with their meanings, or new names built the same way, masculine or feminine. Add a domain, a choir, an epithet or a D&amp;D rank to give your angel a purpose.",
    "sections": [
